WEBVTT

00:00:04.360 --> 00:00:07.260
﻿They've broken through
﻿the final defense line!

00:00:09.960 --> 00:00:12.400
<i>﻿Launch the Gundam!
﻿Launch the Gundam!</i>

00:00:13.530 --> 00:00:15.500
﻿We're counting on you, Iori.

00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:16.700
﻿I've got it.

00:00:35.320 --> 00:00:39.490
﻿Zakus are coming!
But, with the Gundam I made...

00:00:40.560 --> 00:00:42.760
<i>﻿Sei, it's no good!</i>

00:00:42.830 --> 00:00:45.360
Is that you, dad?

00:00:45.470 --> 00:00:46.800
﻿How come you're...?

00:00:46.870 --> 00:00:50.770
<i>Sei, that Gunpla you built...</i>

00:00:52.070 --> 00:00:54.270
<i>﻿Its arm isn't snapped in properly!</i>

00:00:54.340 --> 00:00:56.110
﻿Why!?

00:01:09.790 --> 00:01:11.520
﻿It was just a dream.

00:01:11.520 --> 00:01:12.890
﻿My Gunpla!

00:01:15.130 --> 00:01:19.400
﻿I see, I fell asleep
﻿before making its right arm.

00:01:19.730 --> 00:01:23.040
﻿Sei, please look after
﻿the store for me.

00:01:23.440 --> 00:01:25.500
﻿Okay.

00:01:28.660 --> 00:01:31.690
Colonel Rinko Iori is off to
﻿the 08th Supermarket,

00:01:31.690 --> 00:01:33.830
﻿in order to
﻿procure supplies.

00:01:34.230 --> 00:01:36.100
﻿Supplies for Sukiyaki?

00:01:36.130 --> 00:01:37.500
﻿For vegetable stir-fry.

00:01:37.500 --> 00:01:38.600
﻿No!

00:01:38.600 --> 00:01:43.800
﻿You're the one who said that
﻿my vegetable stir-fry is the best.

00:01:44.010 --> 00:01:45.910
﻿Yeah, but...

00:01:47.440 --> 00:01:49.440
﻿Be good to the customers.

00:01:50.480 --> 00:01:52.110
﻿What customers?

00:01:53.010 --> 00:01:55.050
﻿It's not like our store is
﻿in front of the station.

00:01:55.820 --> 00:01:58.190
﻿Or near the shopping district.

00:01:59.590 --> 00:02:03.720
﻿Why did dad make a
﻿plastic model store here?

00:02:07.160 --> 00:02:09.430
﻿It amazes me every time.

00:02:09.600 --> 00:02:13.130
﻿All these buildings have
﻿people living in them.

00:02:13.300 --> 00:02:15.670
﻿How many times bigger
﻿than Arian could it be?

00:02:15.900 --> 00:02:17.240
﻿Hey!

00:02:17.510 --> 00:02:20.840
﻿What are you doing there?
﻿Get down before you get hurt!

00:02:21.010 --> 00:02:23.410
It's okay, old man.﻿

00:02:23.550 --> 00:02:26.680
﻿Who are you calling old man?
﻿I'm only 25!

00:02:27.020 --> 00:02:29.280
﻿Anyway, get down. Get down!

00:02:35.060 --> 00:02:36.660
﻿Right.

00:02:39.630 --> 00:02:41.530
﻿I've decided where to go!

00:02:48.670 --> 00:02:50.000
﻿Welcome!

00:02:51.710 --> 00:02:53.970
﻿Gundams! So many Gundams!

00:02:54.380 --> 00:02:56.380
﻿Its amazing.

00:02:56.610 --> 00:02:59.280
﻿They're well made.

00:02:59.380 --> 00:03:01.280
﻿Thank you very much.

00:03:01.650 --> 00:03:04.190
﻿I built them for display myself.

00:03:04.950 --> 00:03:06.520
﻿All of them?

00:03:06.560 --> 00:03:07.760
﻿Yes.

00:03:07.760 --> 00:03:09.590
﻿You're amazing.

00:03:09.720 --> 00:03:11.230
﻿Oh, don't.

00:03:11.790 --> 00:03:15.660
If you can build them so well,
﻿you must play Gunpla Battle, too.

00:03:17.670 --> 00:03:19.270
﻿Yeah, kind of...

00:03:19.270 --> 00:03:21.200
﻿You must be good.

00:03:23.410 --> 00:03:28.310
﻿Runner-up in the 2nd Gunpla Battle
﻿Championship World Tournament!?

00:03:29.040 --> 00:03:30.610
﻿That's wonderful!

00:03:30.980 --> 00:03:35.050
﻿That was my dad's...

00:03:35.720 --> 00:03:37.990
﻿Dad, what's this Gunpla?

00:03:39.250 --> 00:03:41.890
﻿I can't quite remember...

00:03:42.920 --> 00:03:44.860
﻿It's the Wing Gundam!

00:03:45.090 --> 00:03:49.230
﻿It can transform into a bird form
﻿for high-speed flight.

00:03:49.900 --> 00:03:53.000
﻿It's also equipped with
﻿a large-caliber buster rifle.

00:03:53.900 --> 00:03:57.100
﻿It excels in both
﻿firepower and mobility.

00:03:58.040 --> 00:04:01.940
By the way, it's a mobile suit
﻿developed by Doctor J,

00:04:01.940 --> 00:04:05.050
﻿for an underground organization
﻿that opposed the Alliance.

00:04:05.050 --> 00:04:07.620
﻿With the launch of Operation Meteor...

00:04:07.950 --> 00:04:10.080
﻿Alright, we've got it.

00:04:10.950 --> 00:04:12.790
﻿Excuse me.

00:04:13.620 --> 00:04:16.590
﻿Keisuke, would you like that one?

00:04:16.790 --> 00:04:18.290
﻿Yeah.

00:04:18.430 --> 00:04:22.830
﻿If you can build Gunpla like him,
﻿you'd be able to win battles for sure.

00:04:25.100 --> 00:04:28.540
﻿I wouldn't be so certain of that.

00:04:29.400 --> 00:04:30.140
﻿Who are you?

00:04:30.440 --> 00:04:31.940
﻿Sazaki...

00:04:33.040 --> 00:04:36.780
﻿Sei Iori's Gunpla is
﻿certainly well-built.

00:04:37.310 --> 00:04:39.680
﻿He didn't just assemble
﻿the plastic models.

00:04:39.680 --> 00:04:43.420
﻿He smoothed out the seams
﻿and colored them with special paint.

00:04:43.420 --> 00:04:46.620
﻿He made them look just like samples.

00:04:48.190 --> 00:04:53.330
﻿But just because they're built well,
﻿it doesn't mean they can win battles.

00:04:53.600 --> 00:04:54.560
﻿Right?

00:04:54.760 --> 00:04:56.130
﻿Th-That's...

00:04:56.730 --> 00:04:59.370
﻿Then let's try it and see.

00:04:59.900 --> 00:05:04.370
﻿Whose Gunpla is better, yours or mine?

00:05:05.870 --> 00:05:07.510
﻿In a Gunpla Battle!

00:05:08.380 --> 00:05:09.540
﻿I wanna see!

00:05:09.880 --> 00:05:11.010
﻿What!?

00:05:11.080 --> 00:05:13.810
﻿Your customers also want to see.

00:05:16.080 --> 00:05:17.650
﻿Are you chickening out?

00:05:20.290 --> 00:05:22.390
﻿Let's play Gunpla Battle.

00:05:23.020 --> 00:05:24.730
﻿There you go.

00:05:27.500 --> 00:05:29.500
<i>﻿Please set your GP Base.</i>

00:05:35.870 --> 00:05:38.570
<i>﻿Beginning Plavsky particle dispersal.</i>

00:05:45.680 --> 00:05:48.020
<i>﻿Field 3, Forest.</i>

00:05:53.190 --> 00:05:55.090
<i>﻿Please set your Gunpla.</i>

00:06:07.840 --> 00:06:09.570
<i>﻿Battle start.</i>

00:06:12.210 --> 00:06:15.010
﻿Sei Iori, Wing Gundam, here I go!

00:06:34.760 --> 00:06:36.800
﻿I'll teach you again...

00:06:37.470 --> 00:06:43.400
﻿Victory in Gunpla Battle isn't decided
﻿only by the quality of the model!

00:06:47.980 --> 00:06:49.080
﻿I need distance!

00:06:49.910 --> 00:06:51.480
﻿I can't allow that!

00:06:53.880 --> 00:06:56.580
﻿Darn...!

00:07:01.360 --> 00:07:03.920
﻿Your reactions are as slow as ever!

00:07:22.680 --> 00:07:23.740
<i>﻿Battle ended.</i>

00:07:31.050 --> 00:07:35.590
﻿Wow! Your Gunpla is so strong!

00:07:35.860 --> 00:07:38.490
﻿Yeah, the stronger always wins...

00:07:38.860 --> 00:07:42.460
﻿That's the only rule of Gunpla Battle!

00:07:42.630 --> 00:07:46.570
﻿Dad, I want the same one he has!

00:07:46.730 --> 00:07:48.700
﻿Is that so? Okay then.

00:07:55.480 --> 00:07:57.340
﻿Thank you very much.

00:07:59.210 --> 00:08:01.110
﻿You should know now.

00:08:01.250 --> 00:08:04.750
﻿You can't win at Gunpla Battle
﻿with your control skills.

00:08:06.420 --> 00:08:08.490
﻿So why don't we team up?

00:08:09.090 --> 00:08:12.530
﻿I'll fight using your
﻿high-performance Gunpla.

00:08:13.090 --> 00:08:16.660
﻿If we enter the championship together,
﻿we'll earn victory and honor.

00:08:17.270 --> 00:08:19.770
﻿This lame store's sales would also...

00:08:19.800 --> 00:08:21.700
﻿- I pass.
- ﻿Huh?

00:08:22.370 --> 00:08:23.940
﻿I've answered this many times.

00:08:24.270 --> 00:08:27.210
﻿You're strong, but your
﻿fighting style is too rough.

00:08:27.610 --> 00:08:30.210
﻿I can't trust you with my Gunpla.

00:08:31.010 --> 00:08:32.380
﻿You're so stubborn.

00:08:33.250 --> 00:08:35.580
﻿The championship is coming soon.

00:08:35.750 --> 00:08:38.390
﻿If you keep on like this,
﻿your defeat is inevitable.

00:08:38.790 --> 00:08:41.990
﻿If you want to win,
﻿you should think twice about it.

00:08:44.390 --> 00:08:46.090
﻿This is so frustrating...

00:08:46.290 --> 00:08:48.660
﻿If only I had better control skills.

00:08:50.530 --> 00:08:53.670
﻿Yeah, just like my dad.

00:09:16.930 --> 00:09:20.730
﻿Player Takeshi Iori has
﻿the top point score!

00:09:22.560 --> 00:09:26.270
﻿If only I could control
﻿Gunpla like that...

00:09:27.970 --> 00:09:28.840
Sei.

00:09:29.800 --> 00:09:31.000
Mom.

00:09:31.140 --> 00:09:33.870
﻿- Is something wrong
- ﻿No, it's nothing.

00:09:35.240 --> 00:09:36.680
﻿I'm going out for a bit.

00:09:36.880 --> 00:09:38.150
﻿Sei?

00:09:39.980 --> 00:09:42.280
﻿I wonder what's wrong with him?

00:09:46.490 --> 00:09:51.260
﻿I want to win. With my models,
﻿and with my ideal movements.

00:09:52.690 --> 00:09:54.800
﻿I want to win at Gunpla Battle!

00:10:31.670 --> 00:10:35.240
﻿The 7th Gunpla Battle Championship
﻿is just about to begin!

00:10:35.970 --> 00:10:38.710
﻿Will you be able to survive?

00:10:40.680 --> 00:10:42.040
﻿Nope.

00:10:42.080 --> 00:10:44.650
﻿They all look so strong!

00:10:44.850 --> 00:10:48.020
﻿Like Sazaki said, at this rate,
﻿if I enter the championship...

00:10:48.950 --> 00:10:53.390
﻿But I'll never team up with a guy
﻿who treats Gunpla like that.

00:10:57.830 --> 00:11:01.530
﻿I'll have to think of some way
﻿to win at Gunpla Battle.

00:11:02.600 --> 00:11:03.860
﻿- Hey.
- ﻿Huh?

00:11:04.170 --> 00:11:05.670
﻿What?

00:11:05.730 --> 00:11:09.300
﻿What's that video playing over there?

00:11:09.600 --> 00:11:12.410
﻿Don't you know about Gunpla Battle?

00:11:12.570 --> 00:11:13.470
﻿What's that?

00:11:14.310 --> 00:11:18.810
﻿You build Gundam plastic models,
﻿or Gunpla, and fight with them.

00:11:18.850 --> 00:11:21.080
﻿That video's a commercial
﻿for the tournament.

00:11:21.320 --> 00:11:22.850
﻿Fight with them...

00:11:23.120 --> 00:11:26.220
﻿So it's like mixed martial arts?

00:11:26.520 --> 00:11:29.260
﻿Well, something like that.

00:11:31.360 --> 00:11:34.260
﻿Looking at him closely,
﻿he doesn't seem to be Japanese.

00:11:34.700 --> 00:11:38.270
﻿But even a foreigner would know
﻿what Gunpla Battle is...

00:11:42.000 --> 00:11:43.800
﻿You want some? It's good.

00:11:44.010 --> 00:11:45.810
﻿No thanks, I...

00:11:45.910 --> 00:11:47.910
﻿Okay. Bye.

00:11:51.650 --> 00:11:53.850
﻿Found you, you little thief!

00:11:54.150 --> 00:11:55.080
﻿What!?

00:11:56.250 --> 00:11:59.250
Hey now, don't walk up to
﻿people and call them thieves!

00:11:59.290 --> 00:12:02.490
﻿How can you say that!?
You stole bread from my store!

00:12:03.520 --> 00:12:04.420
﻿This?

00:12:05.390 --> 00:12:09.160
﻿It was left outside the store.
﻿So I took it, that's all.

00:12:11.470 --> 00:12:12.770
﻿What!?

00:12:13.100 --> 00:12:14.970
﻿It's called storefront sales!

00:12:14.970 --> 00:12:17.040
﻿I can't have you taking
﻿them without paying!

00:12:17.440 --> 00:12:19.470
﻿Then put them somewhere safe!

00:12:19.740 --> 00:12:23.540
﻿What did you say?
﻿How dare you be so brazen!

00:12:23.810 --> 00:12:25.910
﻿I'll take you to the police!

00:12:25.950 --> 00:12:26.710
﻿What!?

00:12:27.050 --> 00:12:28.820
﻿Please hold on a second!

00:12:30.690 --> 00:12:32.520
﻿You're Mr. Iori's...

00:12:32.520 --> 00:12:35.860
﻿I don't think he meant badly.

00:12:36.090 --> 00:12:38.360
﻿I'll pay for it this time.

00:12:47.170 --> 00:12:48.400
﻿Here.

00:12:48.470 --> 00:12:49.670
﻿Thanks.

00:12:52.910 --> 00:12:54.710
﻿What is this?

00:12:54.940 --> 00:12:56.710
﻿It felt weird in my mouth!

00:12:56.810 --> 00:12:58.850
﻿Haven't you ever had soda?

00:12:58.950 --> 00:13:00.610
﻿But it sure tastes good.

00:13:06.120 --> 00:13:09.720
﻿Cool! It's refreshing.

00:13:11.990 --> 00:13:14.390
﻿Guess I caused you trouble.

00:13:14.600 --> 00:13:16.400
﻿It's not your fault.

00:13:16.400 --> 00:13:19.730
﻿You just came from overseas
﻿and don't know Japan well, right?

00:13:20.520 --> 00:13:22.780
﻿We should help others
﻿when they're in need.

00:13:25.910 --> 00:13:28.840
﻿I'll pay you back for this.
﻿That's a promise.

00:13:28.910 --> 00:13:30.510
﻿Don't worry about it.

00:13:30.580 --> 00:13:32.380
﻿I can't do that.

00:13:32.450 --> 00:13:35.980
﻿It's a matter of family dignity.
﻿Our honor will be harmed.

00:13:36.650 --> 00:13:38.820
﻿Sounds really exaggerated.

00:13:40.450 --> 00:13:41.560
﻿I'll give you this.

00:13:41.790 --> 00:13:44.160
﻿What is it? A gem!?

00:13:44.260 --> 00:13:46.430
I ﻿can't take something so expensive.

00:13:46.660 --> 00:13:48.600
﻿It's just a rock.

00:13:48.700 --> 00:13:50.000
﻿Huh?

00:13:50.100 --> 00:13:51.870
﻿And you are...

00:13:52.830 --> 00:13:54.770
﻿I'm Sei. Sei Iori.

00:13:55.640 --> 00:13:57.840
﻿- I'm Reiji.
- ﻿Reiji.

00:13:59.370 --> 00:14:02.780
﻿If you're ever in trouble,
﻿just make a wish on that rock.

00:14:03.480 --> 00:14:07.150
At an time in an situation,
I'll come running.

00:14:08.450 --> 00:14:11.220
﻿I'll handle any sort of trouble.

00:14:13.920 --> 00:14:16.790
﻿That's a promise. I swear.

00:14:20.390 --> 00:14:24.130
﻿Awesome. You're like a superhero...

00:14:25.670 --> 00:14:27.900
﻿Huh? Where'd he go?

00:14:35.610 --> 00:14:37.340
﻿It's beautiful.

00:14:38.680 --> 00:14:40.750
﻿That gem is beautiful.

00:14:41.150 --> 00:14:43.350
﻿It's just a rock.

00:14:43.420 --> 00:14:45.420
﻿Don't you think it's silly?

00:14:45.920 --> 00:14:47.850
﻿What is?

00:15:03.600 --> 00:15:04.500
﻿There.

00:15:06.610 --> 00:15:08.510
﻿Mom, I finished it!

00:15:11.580 --> 00:15:15.380
﻿The unique Gunpla I made for
﻿the Gunpla Battle Championship,

00:15:15.380 --> 00:15:16.850
﻿The Build Strike.

00:15:17.450 --> 00:15:21.660
﻿It's my own original,
﻿based on the Strike Gundam.

00:15:21.860 --> 00:15:24.360
﻿That sounds wonderful.

00:15:24.560 --> 00:15:26.530
﻿It doesn't have rifles
﻿and stuff yet, though.

00:15:27.730 --> 00:15:30.700
﻿I don't know much about
﻿Gunpla as you do, but...

00:15:31.370 --> 00:15:35.170
﻿It has the same kind of aura
﻿as the models your dad built.

00:15:36.900 --> 00:15:38.170
﻿You think?

00:15:39.840 --> 00:15:41.070
﻿Yes.

00:15:43.880 --> 00:15:45.810
﻿Looks like it's finally done.

00:15:46.680 --> 00:15:48.210
﻿You again.

00:15:48.380 --> 00:15:49.980
﻿Hello, Sazaki.

00:15:51.020 --> 00:15:54.490
﻿I see, this is your new model
﻿for the championship.

00:15:54.720 --> 00:15:56.360
﻿It's beautifully made.

00:15:56.360 --> 00:15:58.360
﻿Just right for me to operate!

00:15:58.830 --> 00:16:00.660
﻿This isn't for you!

00:16:00.800 --> 00:16:03.630
﻿Oh, you still don't get it?

00:16:03.760 --> 00:16:07.230
﻿You can't win battles
﻿with your control skills.

00:16:08.670 --> 00:16:13.270
﻿I'll prove it in this battle.
﻿With the Gunpla I built.

00:16:14.280 --> 00:16:15.810
﻿That's the spirit.

00:16:16.040 --> 00:16:18.510
﻿So if you lose...

00:16:18.650 --> 00:16:20.450
﻿You can do as you like with it.

00:16:20.750 --> 00:16:22.380
﻿That's what I wanted to hear!

00:16:22.850 --> 00:16:24.520
﻿Are you sure, Sei?

00:16:24.590 --> 00:16:25.420
﻿It's fine.

00:16:26.090 --> 00:16:28.760
﻿If I can't even defeat him...

00:16:28.920 --> 00:16:30.720
﻿I've heard enough.

00:16:33.960 --> 00:16:37.900
﻿Ral shall be the judge of this battle.

00:16:38.530 --> 00:16:40.200
﻿You came.
﻿Who's he?

00:16:40.740 --> 00:16:42.940
﻿Mr. Ral, one of our regulars.

00:16:44.370 --> 00:16:46.540
﻿You have good eyes.

00:16:47.440 --> 00:16:50.010
﻿They're filled with
confidence and ambition.

00:16:50.110 --> 00:16:51.480
﻿You have guts, too.

00:16:52.580 --> 00:16:56.120
﻿But nothing is guaranteed
﻿on the battlefield, boy.

00:16:57.080 --> 00:16:58.790
﻿Welcome, Mr. Ral.

00:16:59.950 --> 00:17:01.860
﻿M-Mrs. Rinko.

00:17:02.020 --> 00:17:03.920
﻿Excuse me for disturbing you.

00:17:09.360 --> 00:17:11.260
<i>﻿Field 2, Desert.</i>

00:17:12.070 --> 00:17:15.470
﻿Let's have a good look at
your life-or-death contest.

00:17:16.570 --> 00:17:18.740
<i>﻿Please set your Gunpla.</i>

00:17:24.980 --> 00:17:26.450
<i>﻿Battle start.</i>

00:17:29.420 --> 00:17:32.390
﻿Sei Iori, Build Strike, here I go!

00:17:35.390 --> 00:17:37.960
﻿Susumu Sazaki, Gyan, here I come!

00:17:48.700 --> 00:17:51.240
﻿What'll his first move be?

00:17:55.310 --> 00:17:57.280
﻿He dropped his weapons!?

00:17:57.410 --> 00:18:00.510
﻿That's a sign that he'll
﻿fight on equal terms.

00:18:00.950 --> 00:18:02.450
﻿That's not it.

00:18:03.680 --> 00:18:07.720
﻿I don't want him to
﻿make excuses when he loses!

00:18:11.260 --> 00:18:12.430
﻿He's quick!

00:18:12.490 --> 00:18:15.200
﻿Gunpla's performance depends
﻿on how well it's built.

00:18:15.700 --> 00:18:17.630
﻿Sei's new model shows just that.

00:18:18.530 --> 00:18:22.300
﻿But its performance seems to be
﻿too much for him to handle!

00:18:29.210 --> 00:18:33.410
﻿You can build a good machine.
﻿But you can't control it well enough.

00:18:34.420 --> 00:18:36.420
﻿That's the sad reality!

00:18:56.640 --> 00:18:59.840
﻿I don't want to hurt your
﻿machine any more.

00:19:00.010 --> 00:19:02.110
﻿I'll ring you out to end the match.

00:19:06.180 --> 00:19:09.180
﻿I can't get away.
﻿What would dad do?

00:19:12.920 --> 00:19:14.790
﻿I'm going to lose again.

00:19:14.790 --> 00:19:16.620
﻿I haven't done anything yet...

00:19:19.760 --> 00:19:21.660
﻿I don't want to lose.

00:19:21.760 --> 00:19:23.460
﻿I don't want to lose any more!

00:19:28.540 --> 00:19:30.000
﻿Darn it!

00:19:30.140 --> 00:19:31.770
﻿Don't give up!

00:19:32.040 --> 00:19:33.470
﻿Go forward!

00:19:36.640 --> 00:19:37.610
﻿What!?

00:19:44.420 --> 00:19:46.490
﻿Reiji. You...?

00:19:46.890 --> 00:19:48.860
﻿You made a wish.

00:19:48.920 --> 00:19:50.660
﻿That's why I came.

00:19:54.300 --> 00:19:56.760
﻿Sei, I'm going to keep my promise.

00:19:56.860 --> 00:19:59.130
﻿I'll fight in your place!

00:19:59.200 --> 00:20:01.470
﻿But you've never done
﻿this before, right!?

00:20:01.800 --> 00:20:03.100
﻿Leave it to me!

00:20:06.410 --> 00:20:08.680
﻿What are you doing with my Gunpla!?

00:20:09.480 --> 00:20:11.040
﻿Is he Sei's friend?

00:20:11.080 --> 00:20:12.410
﻿Haven't a clue.

00:20:13.980 --> 00:20:17.220
﻿I can't believe it, Sei.

00:20:17.320 --> 00:20:21.450
﻿You're letting an amateur
﻿use your machine?

00:20:22.060 --> 00:20:25.360
﻿That... That Gunpla...

00:20:25.690 --> 00:20:27.860
﻿It's supposed to be mine!

00:20:34.130 --> 00:20:37.170
﻿Okay, I get the idea!

00:20:37.810 --> 00:20:39.110
﻿Don't mess with me!

00:20:48.020 --> 00:20:50.820
﻿It's his first Gunpla Battle,
﻿but those maneuvers...

00:20:51.250 --> 00:20:54.120
﻿Is that boy a Newtype!?

00:20:56.560 --> 00:20:59.260
﻿I won't accept such a thing.

00:20:59.290 --> 00:21:00.690
﻿I won't accept it!

00:21:07.200 --> 00:21:08.940
﻿Don't you have any weapons?

00:21:08.970 --> 00:21:11.740
﻿The third slot.
﻿Beam saber!

00:21:14.640 --> 00:21:16.440
﻿Found it!

00:21:23.020 --> 00:21:24.580
﻿That movement is just like my dad's...

00:21:27.890 --> 00:21:30.720
﻿﻿This is what I was looking for.
My ideal...!

00:21:32.190 --> 00:21:33.390
﻿What?

00:21:34.580 --> 00:21:36.340
﻿Who are you!?

00:21:37.530 --> 00:21:40.370
﻿You're finished now!

00:22:00.490 --> 00:22:01.690
<i>﻿Battle ended.</i>

00:22:02.720 --> 00:22:06.230
﻿My Gunpla... it won.

00:22:08.160 --> 00:22:12.070
﻿I... I lost the battle...?

00:22:13.300 --> 00:22:15.070
﻿That was a great match.

00:22:15.070 --> 00:22:16.570
﻿Congratulations, Sei.

00:22:17.170 --> 00:22:20.770
﻿It wasn't me.
﻿My Gunpla won because of...

00:22:22.310 --> 00:22:24.240
﻿Where did he go?

00:22:27.110 --> 00:22:29.180
﻿Reiji!

00:22:30.080 --> 00:22:30.980
﻿Sei!

00:22:32.550 --> 00:22:33.690
﻿I finally found one!

00:22:34.490 --> 00:22:39.360
﻿At any time, in any situation,
﻿I'll come running.

00:22:39.990 --> 00:22:43.430
﻿He's the fighter who can best
﻿control my Gunpla!

00:22:44.370 --> 00:22:47.830
﻿I'll handle any sort of trouble.

00:22:48.500 --> 00:22:51.370
﻿Someone who can
﻿realize my ideals!

00:22:51.970 --> 00:22:55.580
﻿That's a promise. l swear.

00:23:19.030 --> 00:23:22.140
Reiji, we'll meet again.

00:23:22.200 --> 00:23:24.440
Let's fight in the
Gunpla Battle together!

00:23:25.670 --> 00:23:28.980
﻿I want to battle with you!

00:23:33.980 --> 00:23:35.380
﻿I'm home.

00:23:36.350 --> 00:23:38.350
﻿Mom, I'm sorry I'm late.

00:23:41.990 --> 00:23:43.190
﻿You're back!

00:23:43.520 --> 00:23:44.860
﻿Welcome home, Sei.

00:23:45.090 --> 00:23:47.990
﻿What's going on, Reiji!?

00:23:48.080 --> 00:23:50.110
﻿What are you talking about?

00:23:52.160 --> 00:23:54.470
Didn't you make a wish?

00:23:55.930 --> 00:23:57.230
﻿Reiji came to school!?

00:23:57.230 --> 00:23:58.830
Let's fight together, Sei.

00:23:59.670 --> 00:24:01.440
﻿Next episode, "The Crimson Comet".

00:24:01.470 --> 00:24:04.410
Will I be able to survive school?
